define user ask off topic
  "who won the cricket match?"
  "how do I bake a cake?"
  "write a poem about space"
  "what is the capital of France?"
  "give me stock market advice"

define bot refuse to answer off topic
  "🛑 Out of Scope: I am a specialized Farmer Scheme Assistant. I can only answer questions related to agriculture, farming, weather, and government schemes."

define flow off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse to answer off topic